  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb (Expensive)<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1<br><strong>Fits:</strong> All Two-Handed Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p>Needs Skill 7+ in the weapon's Skill or Combat Awareness 2+, and a two-handed grip. Reduces your total attack penalty from Armor Penalties, Critical Injuries, and Wound States by 1, or by 2 on Aimed Shots. The situational +1 is for when you have such a penalty (use +2 by hand on Aimed Shots). No Underbarrel attachments; can't be combined with a Foregrip.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Grips &amp; Controls).</em></p>"
